</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Our capital expenditures were $0.2 million, $0.1 million and $0.2 million
for the years ended December 31, 2022, 2021 and 2020, respectively. These capital expenditures were incurred primarily for investments
in facilities, leasehold improvements, equipment and technology.</p><div>

