    <td style="vertical-align: bottom">&#160;</td>
    <td style="vertical-align: bottom; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Independent Non-Executive Director and Chair of Compensation Committee</span></td></tr>
