Scherer was appointed as one of our directors as of October 2017 and is entitled to receive $31,673 annually for his services as a director
effective from January 1, 2022.</span></td>
</tr></table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

