to his appointment letter, Dr. Cheng received 10% of Aptorum Medical Limited&#8217;s ordinary shares as of the date of this annual report.
ACC Medical Limited, is a company wholly-owned by Dr. Cheng. Dr. Cheng maintains sole voting control over the shares held by ACC Medical
Limited, the principal office address of which is at Unit 1, 13/F, Block A, 19-25 Jervois Street, Hong Kong.</span></td></tr>
