</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_15" id="_IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_14"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><span style="text-decoration:underline">Deferred tax asset, net</span></p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_16" id="_IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_15"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Deferred tax assets and deferred tax liabilities
reflect the tax effects of temporary differences between the carrying amounts of assets and liabilities for financial reporting purpose
and the tax bases used for income tax purpose. The following represents the tax effect of each major type of temporary difference.</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

</div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_17" id="_IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_16"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfDeferredTaxAssetsAndLiabilitiesTableTextBlock"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
