to directors, employees, external consultants and advisors of the Group with an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c296" decimals="1" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares">13.4</ix:nonFraction> per share, which was based on
