</div><ix:continuation id="_CommitmentsAndContingenciesDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_6"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">For the years ended December 31, 2022, 2021 and
2020, the Group incurred $<span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-282">nil</span>, $<span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-283">nil</span> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c11" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="apm:MilestonePayments" scale="0" unitRef="usd">129,203</ix:nonFraction> milestone payments, respectively. For the years ended December 31, 2022, 2021 and 2020,
the Group did not incur any royalties or research and development funding, respectively.</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

